+---
+id: task-003-reject-invalid-task-input
+type: task
+title: "Reject invalid task input"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Reject invalid task input with a clear error, without changing the list. Titles must contain non-space
+content and be at most 120 characters. Priorities must be `low`, `normal` or `high`. Tags must be
+non-empty and contain no spaces. Enforce these rules when adding tasks (including their priority and
+tags), renaming tasks and adding tags.
